  "content": {
    "_uid": "087e1c92-d31a-b7f2-a1d4-12998774bb3d",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "a5391135-32bd-c374-bbca-ba70d8479be1",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Covering a spectrum of essential topics including hypertension simulation, coronary lesion assessment, heart failure imaging, ECG mastery, and 3D heart mapping, these workshops provided a comprehensive platform for skill enhancement and knowledge exchange. Engaging 112 participants, the workshops demonstrated the growing importance of hands-on cardiac simulation in refining clinical competencies and improving patient outcomes.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The Pulse Conference emphasized the crucial role of simulation-based learning in augmenting the capabilities of healthcare professionals. By employing a simulation-based approach, participants gained practical insights and immersive experiences, effectively bridging the gap between theoretical knowledge and real-world application. This successful event underscored the effectiveness of simulation in advancing cardiac care and strengthening the skills of healthcare practitioners.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
