    "show_share": true,
    "description": "In a remarkable collaboration, the 5th Pulse Conference unfolded at AKU from January 12th to 14th, 2024, marking a significant stride in cardiac education and professional development. Dedicated to cardiac professionals and educators, the conference spotlighted innovative approaches to cardiovascular care and featured a series of impactful pre-workshops hosted at CIME.",
